&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with relational database management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid mathematics background, particularly statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of interest rate derivatives and risk is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering projects from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great problem solver&lt;/li&gt;
