&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in mainstream quant programming languages, such as Python and C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Book Portfolio Manager Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent and formula-based compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to contribute to other research and strategy initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to WorldQuant’s alpha pool, portfolio management tools and innovative technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a deep and broad menu of datasets supported by a dedicated data team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-asset execution led by a multi-regional trading team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in internal research conferences and forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy to build your own strategies along with several opportunities for collaboration and mentorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI and Machine Learning opportunities applied to financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
