&lt;h5&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;D., M.S., or B.S. degree from a leading university in a quantitative or highly analytical field (e.g. Industrial Engineering, Physics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Financial Engineering, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent academic record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ or Python or in other programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem solving abilities and judgment with a strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
