&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Jump Trading is hiring an Early Career Talent Development Programs Specialist in Singapore to join our global Talent Development team, a part of our broader People Operations department. In this role, you’ll partner with research, trading and technology leaders across the firm to design and deliver world-class learning and development programs. Our people and culture are our top priority, and we&#39;re looking for someone who&#39;s passionate about helping others grow in our creative, fast-paced environment. If this sounds like you, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
