&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with technical &amp;amp; business leads and managers to understand business goals, knowledge/skill needs, team fit dynamics, individual growth opportunities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;available, and route campus talent to high impact areas. Manage campus talent mobility processes&amp;nbsp;with data, transparency, and empathy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboratively develop new and creative&amp;nbsp;educational programming &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;development initiatives&amp;nbsp;geared towards Early Career talent&amp;nbsp;by leveraging&amp;nbsp;industry trends,&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; external resources/experts, and&amp;nbsp;ensuring&amp;nbsp;alignment&amp;nbsp;with local&amp;nbsp;culture,&amp;nbsp;customs&amp;nbsp;and perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
