&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Serve as the manager for&amp;nbsp;interns&amp;nbsp;full-time&amp;nbsp;campus hires&amp;nbsp;during their onboarding and upfront project work: Set goals, run 1:1s, deliver timely&amp;nbsp;feedback, coach mentors, and address performance risks early in partnership with HR and&amp;nbsp;business leadership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to ops/data/logistical tasks: onboarding, scheduling,&amp;nbsp;communication campaigns,&amp;nbsp;workspace/equipment&amp;nbsp;set up, vendor&amp;nbsp;management, content &amp;amp; material coordination, etc. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Propose, pilot, and iterate on solutions across the Early Career lifecycle; scale what works and challenge legacy processes when a better approach exists. Ensure that Early Careers initiatives represent and promote Firm’s culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
