&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3dfe6e478b82&quot;&gt;Oversee and manage the full portfolio of HPC infrastructure projects, ensuring alignment with business priorities and timely delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa330aeb61b4&quot;&gt;Drive prioritization of infrastructure projects based on business impact, resource availability, and technical dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2272&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fedbb9187d52&quot;&gt;Step in to directly plan and execute infrastructure projects as needed, including scoping, scheduling, resource allocation, and stakeholder coordination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
