&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65bdd0b346a5&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2455&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ff19988e2f5&quot;&gt;Provide high-level project reporting and status updates to leadership, maintaining visibility into progress, risks, and resource needs across all active projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
