&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2655&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f1860a670adb&quot;&gt;Manage contractor relationships end-to-end, including contract negotiations, schedule coordination, performance oversight, and relationship management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2810&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e2b5a3cab239&quot;&gt;Work with major IT vendors to troubleshoot and resolve implementation and operational issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
