&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9ec753e3e45&quot;&gt;Must actively use AI tools in day-to-day work to drive efficiency in project planning, reporting, analysis, and operational workflows. AI fluency is a core expectation of this role.&lt;/p&gt;
