&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4058&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2cf5f33069b0&quot;&gt;Experience with project planning tools and methodologies for infrastructure deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4150&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d17869297945&quot;&gt;Previous experience demonstrating strategic thinking skills and maturity in tackling complex problems, dealing with people, technology, and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4304&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1228b8669f59&quot;&gt;Good judgment, ability to evaluate short and long-term impact, and confidence to select and execute decisions when required and take full responsibility for end results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4477&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10d98e2fc7c0&quot;&gt;Demonstrates a high level of energy, results driven, and able to work under pressure with tight deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4587&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a05f23e4b60c&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, with the ability to provide clear project reporting to leadership and work across a global engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90c296fde93d&quot;&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1426e2977656&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4777&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6156ceccc0a0&quot;&gt;Experience planning and operating high-density/HPC data center environments, including power, cooling, space, and structured cabling considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4929&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0a68ab6bb6ef&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of networking concepts, configuration, and troubleshooting. A qualification like CCNA is great; equivalent experience is also fine.&lt;/p&gt;
