&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5198&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c58c3204689d&quot;&gt;Proficiency with scripting languages (such as Python) for automation and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5298&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d626cefcfa1c&quot;&gt;Extremely high personal standards for work quality.&lt;/p&gt;
