&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5353&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76227f559a68&quot;&gt;Reliable and predictable availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5395&quot; data-local-id=&quot;354a7b3df63b&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, or related field preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
