&lt;p&gt;The Global Treasury Team is looking to expand the Portfolio Finance function. In this role, you will play an important part in managing the daily financing of the firm and assist in helping develop the next iteration of Treasury within Jump. You will also interact with both the EMEA and US team – and will interact with all levels of various departments throughout the global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
