&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Staying up to date on state-of-the-art technologies in high performance computing industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
