&lt;p&gt;This is a new team operating on a collaborative basis, with a rare opportunity to work on challenging problems across the full business scope and have outsized impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location is flexible for the right candidate, though Hong Kong or New York are preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
