&lt;p&gt;This is a new team operating on a collaborative basis, with a rare opportunity to work on challenging problems across the full business scope and have outsized impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location is flexible for the right candidate, though New York or Hong Kong are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
