78045dcc076c1ca207ece152ae01162ea5f748f1:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An opportunity to join a growing team, primarily working on the day to day inventory management and logistics of physical metals alongside assisting with the growth and development of the firms processes and procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of physical metals inventory specifically concentrates metals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with Investment team on new physical purchase and sale contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Checking documentation related to physical metal contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation and review of contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing inventory reporting and updates to the Investment team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining documentation relating to physical contracts and inventory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arranging inspections of inventory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arranging logistics for movement of metal globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control exposure under Weighing Sampling and Moisture Determination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coordinate hedging instructions and QP declarations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in&amp;nbsp;concentrates&amp;nbsp;metals commercial operations and logistics including in China&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Chinese both spoken and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of physical metals markets and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of LME and CME metals products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proficiency in all calculations used to support any products in your asset class coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the importance of our team concept. Establish long-lasting organizational relationships that will foster a productive work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proficiency in written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on system and process improvements, and new business initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the relevant technology and applications that are required to excel in the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer focused&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

941931373c567a3e9df6403ad004bb45cc872472:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Communications Associate is responsible for supporting the internal and external communications strategies for the firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the executive management team to make sure that top-down communications flow smoothly and resonate with employees of all functions, levels and locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the various stakeholders in the Investment, Technology and Corporate teams to strengthen connectivity and awareness across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and distribute communications tailored for specific audiences including various firm newsletters, organizational announcements, and updates on firm initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the success of communication campaigns, and adapt the strategy based on data and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Investor Relations to create marketing decks and investor relations materials&lt;/li&gt;
