0995fe66a7362525db2faaf088e5aa12f58af3ab:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Hours: This role requires working on shifts to support 24/7 coverage across regions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Squarepoint is building a Central Trading &amp;amp; Monitoring team to ensure around-the-clock supervision of trading activities and operational processes. As a Shift Trader, you will play a critical role in risk management, trade oversight, operational lifecycle management, and incident response. You will also actively contribute to the automation and efficiency of the team’s workflow by developing tools and scripts to streamline monitoring and trading operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active Risk Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;5a2ffa96-a516-425f-8df2-0a058835c985&quot;&gt;Monitor real-time exposures across Squarepoint’s trading activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;167772e8-0e4d-4c62-9a42-beb8d1ba238d&quot;&gt;Proactively raise alerts and escalate incidents as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;1913f9ff-5a3e-4a5d-ab39-5182cc2b0063&quot;&gt;Execute hedging actions following established procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;1913f9ff-5a3e-4a5d-ab39-5182cc2b0063&quot;&gt;Monitor profit and loss, and risk metrics, ensuring continuity during market holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;4fc69b41-555c-4f58-8026-aaaade7b2ff8&quot;&gt;Oversee systematic trading strategies, including restarting as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;d4b571e4-ed07-455b-bf92-c568e113bcca&quot;&gt;Respond to alerts and ensure the smooth operation of trading processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;d4b571e4-ed07-455b-bf92-c568e113bcca&quot;&gt;Support internal teams with issue escalation and resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad-hoc Trading &amp;amp; Operations Tasks:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;80e53f69-60e8-4125-816c-4f271a56a1ee&quot;&gt;Perform ad-hoc hedging and booking tasks as they arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;6d54067b-1dba-4832-a7c3-948f7de4019e&quot;&gt;Support pilots and special initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;86d1ddc4-ce3d-4c7c-99c4-6d8ac45894a3&quot;&gt;Respond to diverse requests from internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional oversight areas (as activity scales):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market-making activities and exposures, taking action in case of issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and improve tools to run post-execution analysis and achieve best execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;06a540a9-dc5d-4844-9df9-8061f904f942&quot;&gt;Support trading of new products as they are launched (e.g., power and gas markets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;7ca0f18b-3cd3-4d8b-84eb-240a9c04888e&quot;&gt;Oversee lifecycle management tasks, including monitoring of position rolls, option expirations, and corporate actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;6dcc899e-7242-4db4-89f7-488181c64eed&quot;&gt;Respond rapidly to risk limit breaches and serve as a contact point for market counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;3124fa7d-b893-48f7-b66b-3af7f714775f&quot;&gt;Support near round-the-clock trading, including special coverage for weekend or holiday markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicate time to streamlining monitoring and booking workflows using scripting or automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start&quot; data-uuid=&quot;c5efd32a-26b7-473b-ba06-d6b904a12fec&quot;&gt;Engage with stakeholders to identify new requirements and extend team responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;37b184c9-3367-4f5d-81e5-8ad4ccf97567&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;091e1aa8-7bde-4985-acfb-3db7789ea59d&quot;&gt;Programming proficiency in Python. KDB is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0413f5f0-11c7-4021-8b5b-fe3f0b8af354&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills with the ability to collaborate with teammates globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;53cc0ffa-a788-4ad9-b63b-3801af4a2112&quot;&gt;Strong sense of urgency with the ability to work well in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

c1cdfb81f647c6e44150871afc74d62ed9522d3d:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Site Management team has the overall responsibility for managing Infrastructure space, power, physical security and structured cabling across all Squarepoint’s data centers, offices, and colocations facilities. This team collaborates closely with internal stakeholders and external partners to establish and enforce design standards, implementation strategies, techniques, runbooks, and procedural documents that govern the delivery of infrastructure projects globally, ensuring both consistency and quality.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is essential to new construction, expansion, relocation and capital improvement projects requiring strong project management, IT network and server infrastructure knowledge, and a comprehension of mechanical and electrical engineering. Qualified candidates will be process-driven, critical thinkers and have the aptitude to work on large projects with many dependencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW72652228 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW72652228 BCX0&quot;&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with infrastructure stakeholders to develop, implement, and continuously improve standards and run books that are used in the design and commissioning of data centers, offices, and colocation facilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead/direct vendors via Scope of Work and Requests for Proposals/information documents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
