c7cf7b9a54f03c5f809080133f9da7f58259da5f:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;As a Technical Business Analyst , you will be the key driver of the entire project lifecycle; starting from using requirements elicitation techniques to gather business requirements, identify problems or discover gaps, evaluate project objectives and track progress, to ultimately ensure successful delivery of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;2129101c-1601-417b-b247-cd8704e5b69b&quot;&gt;This presents the opportunity to take ownership of the business objectives and the development of technology solutions to facilitate the growth of the business. You will act as the primary interface between senior stakeholders, Business Product Management Team, Quantitative Research, Trading, Development, Quality Assurance, Production Support and Infrastructure Teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main responsibilities for&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Technical Business Analysts&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze current business processes and establish the full picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical needs and problems to solve based on thorough analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and scope requirements into technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solutions, propose implementation options, provide evaluations and recommendations to make optimal decisions for the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the product design that aligns with firm-wide goals by collaborating with business and technology stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain product and project specifications with exceptionally high level of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage functional/technical knowledge and content and drive outstanding questions towards closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish project implementation plan and proactively&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;bb771112-4332-4df9-ae92-ff32af981d89&quot;&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;project progress while managing multiple priorities and communicating the priorities effectively to the project stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate for this role should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong requirement elicitation skills: ability to capture, conceptualize and structure requirements to simple, concise and comprehensive requirement specifications to minimize requirement gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation skills: ability to create and maintain highly accurate requirement specifications, project and product documents according to Squarepoint documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to abstract concepts, identify gaps and subtle differences, connect dots, internalize information, relate information to implications and question effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and maintain strategic partnerships with senior management, project stakeholders and end users globally, as well as communicate effectively across business and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding on software/hardware concepts, software architecture design and software development lifecycle (Waterfall or Agile).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of various asset classes in either listed or OTC financial instruments such as Equities, Futures, Options or Fixed Income instruments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, independent, reliable, collaborative and strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-organized, exceptionally high level of accuracy in both written and verbal communication and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on multiple projects simultaneously across different&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;3a4e17ad-2179-4cab-93d1-3fdf974818b4&quot;&gt;domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years of total industry experience within finance with at least 2 years in a Technical Business Analyst position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on programming experience is required, preferably in Python or KDB+/q.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atlassian Confluence and JIRA expertise is required, including corresponding macros/plug-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in initiating, defining, driving&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;096bfc8b-84c8-431f-99f0-9604e2647703&quot;&gt;and implementing&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;projects with explicitly scoped project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a Computer Science, Engineering field or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Microservice, Domain-Driven Design, API Design, cloud-native applications, distributed systems and DevOps is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

b9cc73afca12b347a81d6c99e0f1769955241f7d:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integration projects team plays a crucial role in the analysis, planning, and coordination of upgrades, rollouts, and decommission across firm’s trading, research, and UX’s front-to-back workflows. As an integral member of team, you will collaborate closely with a wide range of technology teams and quantitative researchers, offering you the opportunity to gain a deep understanding of technology architecture, business operations, and to develop your project management and organizational skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Project manage large scale firm wide roll outs of applications and infrastructure, user migrations from legacy to newer systems, high impact changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Project manage business/external driven requirements requiring cross team coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as liaison between technology teams, business users and external parties during various stages of application and infrastructure delivery for in-scope projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Increase transparency for stakeholders by maintaining quality project tracking documentation and regular communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Use of scripting/automations for project impact assessment and data collection for migration tracking dashboards.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Engineering, or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of software/hardware/network concepts, software development life cycle and processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Bash and any scripting language such as Python or Perl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Atlassian stack (JIRA, Service Desk, Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to reporting tools like Tableau Dashboard, Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

d825eaee7355236b4ee468718cc9e25718605d88:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global trading platform readiness: pre-trading &amp;amp; post-trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide monitoring and support for end to end transaction flow across the trading platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly identify, analyze and correct alerts &amp;amp; issues and/or escalate to minimize trade flow impact and preempt outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident management: create and send reports following established process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intensive interaction with trading community, back office operations, brokers, exchanges, development and infrastructure teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scheduled changes: application deployments, network implementations and server maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee automated processes, scheduled jobs and regular reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage users’ requests: track requests, review approvals, updates, resolution, closure, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies such as repetitive activities, manual processes and suboptimum tools/workflows to drive continuous improvements via automation, collaboration with internal and external teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on trade flow support experience a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Bash and a scripting language such as Python or Perl required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed practical knowledge of FIX. Ideally, familiarity with native exchange protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kdb+ is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge with TCP/IP, multicast, tcpdump, clocking (PTP, NTP) – a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, Engineering or related subject&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detailed, control oriented, enjoys solving problems and brings in a &quot;take charge&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal/written communication skills required to support daily interaction with brokers, exchanges, and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated individual that takes initiatives and has an ownership &amp;amp; accountability mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must show the ability to make quick decisions and establish priorities in a multi-tasking &amp;amp; fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Atlassian stack (JIRA, Service Desk, Confluence, Bitbucket, Bamboo), Elastic Stack and Nagios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ITIL is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

e9c5f87909c121156357cdd0ff9ecf1c4dcbeeef:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Trading Infrastructure Support Engineer will be part of a highly talented team of support engineers responsible for ensuring high availability of&amp;nbsp;Squarepoint’s&amp;nbsp;mission&amp;nbsp;critical services such Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS), Build &amp;amp; Deploy, Research&amp;nbsp;and Trading. The candidate will be responsible for providing L1/L2 support across all services globally distributed across APAC, EMEA&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;AMER&amp;nbsp;regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide monitoring and&amp;nbsp;L1/L2&amp;nbsp;support across all&amp;nbsp;services and quickly react to any outages to maintain a highly available environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly identify, analyze and correct alerts &amp;amp; issues and/or escalate to minimize trade flow impact and preempt outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intensive interaction with trading community,&amp;nbsp;external vendors,&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and infrastructure&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee automated processes, scheduled jobs and regular reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp;users’ requests:&amp;nbsp;track requests,&amp;nbsp;review&amp;nbsp;approvals,&amp;nbsp;updates,&amp;nbsp;resolution, closure, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies such as repetitive activities, manual processes and suboptimum tools/workflows to drive continuous improvements via automation, collaboration with internal and external teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of support experience a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Linux/Unix&amp;nbsp;administration (RHEL/CentOS/OEL preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Python,&amp;nbsp;Bash&amp;nbsp;scripting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working&amp;nbsp;knowledge of storage and different storage protocols (nfs &amp;nbsp;gpfs a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure automation (Chef, Puppet or Ansible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or like messaging buses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CICD tooling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Monitoring infrastructure (ELK and Prometheus preferred)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database administration experience (MySql&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;PosgreSql&amp;nbsp;preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in container software administration (Docker,&amp;nbsp;Podman,&amp;nbsp;Kubernetes, GKE&amp;nbsp;or Helm preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge with TCP/IP, multicast,&amp;nbsp;tcpdump, clocking (PTP, NTP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate network equipment command line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree&amp;nbsp;in Computer Science, Engineering or related subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized,&amp;nbsp;detailed, control oriented,&amp;nbsp;enjoys solving problems and&amp;nbsp;brings in&amp;nbsp;a &quot;take charge&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal/written communication skills required to support daily interaction with internal teams,&amp;nbsp;external vendors and service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated individual that takes initiatives and has an ownership &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;accountability mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must show the ability to make quick decisions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;establish priorities in a multi-tasking &amp;amp; fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;ITIL is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

7abfe45d39e5e210e884dcf346319c12ea8f756e:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Squarepoint is seeking a hands-on Trading Infrastructure Support (TIS) Tech Lead to manage a global TIS team. The candidate will lead a team of support specialist, ensuring high availability of Squarepoint’s mission-critical infrastructure, systems, and platform application services across APAC, EMEA, and AMER regions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Manage a 24x5 global support schedule and weekend on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define policies, processes, roadmaps, and best practices to meet SLAs and scale with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with service teams to build automation, self-service tools, and runbooks. Ensure the team is trained, skilled, and empowered to remove blockers and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and eliminate inefficiencies across workflows and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and coordinate technical efforts across the global support team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with troubleshooting and&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;major outage recovery efforts to minimize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Main Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a 24x5 global support schedule and weekend on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define policies, processes, roadmaps, and best practices to meet SLAs and scale with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with service teams to build automation, self-service tools, and runbooks. Ensure the team is trained, skilled, and empowered to remove blockers and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and eliminate inefficiencies across workflows and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and coordinate technical efforts across the global support team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with troubleshooting and&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;major outage recovery efforts to minimize impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in Linux/Unix administration (RHEL/CentOS/OEL preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of CI/CD practices, including observability, orchestration, containerization, automated testing, deployment pipelines, and configuration management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;leading a technology team, ideally in infrastructure support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal, written, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service orientation and strategic mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, prioritization, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of storage protocols (NFS, GPFS a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure automation tools (Chef, Puppet, Ansible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of networking fundamentals (TCP/IP, multicast, tcpdump, PTP, NTP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL knowledge is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

72d3d7ec7f240f209f5737520fc09e8fdf1a1b12:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please only apply to the one job you feel best fits your skillset and experience. If our team feels you are better suited for another role, we will reach out about the alternate opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Trading Applications Specialist at Squarepoint, you will work in a global team of exceptional technologists with the primary focus of ensuring reliability and stability of our trading services. You will develop a deep understanding of financial markets, combining this knowledge with strong technical skills to support systematic trading applications and other critical software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will step into a high responsibility role, taking ownership of incident management and root cause elimination through process improvements. Trading Applications Specialists drive continuous innovation via automation and optimisation of our daily workflows. In this role you will learn how we manage application outages and minimise their negative impact on our large-scale global trading operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out ready for business checks ahead of the &#39;start-of-day&#39; to ensure a smooth market open, resolving any failures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor trading applications and execution strategies, utilising our proprietary observability frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out post trade checks and resolve reporting issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your critical thinking skills and manage outages that impact the trading environment, reducing production downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on a wide range of projects, including: onboarding of new applications, services and products into the production environment or developing tools and scripts to automate operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Mechanical Engineering, Mathematics or a similar discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 4 years experience in a similar environment, buy or sell side&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux, Python, Bash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of at least one of the following asset classes: equities, fixed income, derivatives, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, attention to detail and ability to work within a global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to continuously learn new technologies and develop with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and driven by the challenge of solving new problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with either of: kdb+/q, MSSQL, PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with the FIX protocol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of TCP/IP concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The minimum base salary for this role is $100,000 if located in New York. &amp;nbsp;This expectation is based on available information at the time of posting. &amp;nbsp;This role may be eligible for discretionary bonuses, which could constitute a significant portion of total compensation.&amp;nbsp; This role may also be eligible for benefits, such as health, dental, and other wellness plans, as well as 401(k) contributions.&amp;nbsp; Successful candidates’ compensation and benefits will be determined in consideration of various factors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

e9f0b6c8853b920d77211dcf3a6310589cb554bb:
&lt;p&gt;Trading Infrastructure Specialists play an important role maintaining &lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;3ffbf428-4e3c-43f1-a952-9dc6ff807ec5&quot;&gt;mission critical trading software and systems&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the Squarepoint technology stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will be joining our Trading Infrastructure Support Team on an 18-month rotation programme. During this time, you will be exposed to a wide array of technologies across our Infrastructure estate and be supported by&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;4a2f17d6-1445-47e0-a076-79e229a55702&quot;&gt;established members of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the end of the rotation, you will have the tools and knowledge to move into one of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;0718d906-2b83-4f0e-8293-a895d734c2d7&quot;&gt;DevOps/Systems&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;teams,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;46207b07-1ed2-406a-8e1d-e3bb63039e04&quot;&gt;or you can opt to stay within Trading Infrastructure Support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things you will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be enrolled in a structured training programme with a dedicated mentor who will support you throughout your journey here at Squarepoint. Within the first few months you will learn about the tech stacks for our infrastructure teams and gain exposure to our application stack for trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside our support team to learn how we address user issues, understand our handling standards, and gain the ability to triage and prioritise problems as they come up. You will have the opportunity to work with technologies such as Linux, Kubernetes, high-performance computing (HPC), distributed storage, load balancing, and more. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Towards the end of the programme there will be 1-week rotations within our DevOps and Systems teams so that you can gain hands-on experience within those areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once initial training is complete, a normal day in this role could involve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;bded1765-39fe-4249-a7c3-63e9f36712b0&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting and automation across a wide array of core systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;54d17a6b-3982-40b7-83c3-5339b81e5643&quot;&gt;Engaging with service owners&amp;nbsp;on day-to-day operational issues,&amp;nbsp;triage, manage and&amp;nbsp;resolving incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c78eb32e-86bc-43ae-b3ba-e39dbfa86207&quot;&gt;Supporting observability, workload schedulers, databases, and Linux systems depending on team needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1655f8d4-5064-4eb3-883c-202cc806b4ac&quot;&gt;Contributing to automation tasks using Python, Bash, or Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;92fd872a-de7e-4362-8f48-38c9e35abbdb&quot;&gt;Maintain monitoring, alerting, and logging pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d0c36c0e-4e15-476e-addc-50e3b8b95782&quot;&gt;Document issues, update runbooks, to aid your colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d6ca1c60-447f-4270-a3a7-9b4da8b5eefe&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in engineering, Computer Science, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
