3eca6c8e4d4d9d9e98a648c92ddd1755784dda93:
&lt;p&gt;Jump Trading Group is committed to world class research. We empower exceptional talents in Mathematics, Physics, and Computer Science to seek scientific boundaries, push through them, and apply cutting edge research to global financial markets. Our culture is unique. Constant innovation requires fearlessness, creativity, intellectual honesty, and a relentless competitive streak. We believe in winning together and unlocking unique individual talent by incenting collaboration and mutual respect. At Jump, research outcomes drive more than superior risk adjusted returns. We design, develop, and deploy technologies that change our world, fund start-ups across industries, and partner with leading global research organizations and universities to solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jump Trading is seeking a detail-oriented, proactive, and people-focused Facilities Manager to own the maintenance, operations, and overall performance of our current and future offices in New York City. You will ensure the reliability of essential infrastructure, the day-to-day functionality of the office, and the well-being of our employees as it relates to their workplace experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a role built on ownership and leadership. You will drive facilities strategy across all locations, lead a team of internal and external professionals, and manage the vendors, contractors, and building staff who keep our offices running seamlessly. You will also play an active part in the design and eventual operation of a new 100,000 sq ft office in a tier one NYC building. We operate our offices for our own people—no clients, no shareholders—simply to make the best possible workday for our fellow coworkers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the daily performance, availability, and reliability of all office and critical facility systems—including UPS, BMS/EPMS, backup generators, transfer switches (ATS/STS), and HVAC/cooling equipment (CRAC/CRAH, chillers).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run preventative and corrective maintenance programs—daily walkthroughs, load tests, inspections, and emergency drills such as generator testing and UPS failover—to prevent downtime and extend asset life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary escalation point for critical events, driving rapid incident response and using maintenance data and system-health trends to continuously improve reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and develop a team of internal and external supervisors, engineers, and technicians—setting goals, coaching for growth, and driving a culture of safety and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee hiring, onboarding, performance management, and succession planning to build bench strength.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relationships with building management and vendors—running RFPs, consolidations, and contract negotiations, and holding partners accountable to measurable performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and supervise outsourced maintenance, infrastructure upgrades, capacity expansions, and commissioning, ensuring alignment with approved MOPs, SOPs, and change-management controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide in-house expertise on office maintenance, renovations, and buildouts, and strategic analysis of any new leases or subleases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial compliance (fire and building code, FDNY, OSHA, current Local Law) and maintain thorough records of assets, maintenance logs, inspections, and operating procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the facilities budget and capex planning, identifying automation and AI-driven efficiencies and developing SOPs that scale across global offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the design of the new 100,000 sq ft office to ensure a seamless transition of the facilities program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and respond to service tickets to prioritize and coordinate responses to staff and completion of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Workplace Services, IT, Security, Operations, and Legal to keep critical trading infrastructure (power, internet, HVAC, backup systems) highly reliable and serve as the primary point of contact for critical facilities issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform handyman duties as needed (small repairs, painting, simple installations, lifting, onsite presence during installations) and coordinate office moves to preserve continuity of design and operations.&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10-15+ years of experience in facilities management, building operations, or workplace infrastructure, preferably in an office environment with mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience operating a 50,000+ sq ft commercial office in NYC (Class A or B), including HVAC, MEP, life-safety, and base-building coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3+ years of management experience leading a high-performing team—setting goals, supporting daily execution, and coaching for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge of electrical systems, UPS, HVAC/cooling equipment, fire suppression, and transfer switches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of multi-vendor portfolios and large facilities budgets, with proven experience in vendor management, scheduling, and contract negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of NYC commercial building codes, FDNY/OSHA requirements, current Local Law, and energy-efficiency standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with building management systems (preferably Schneider EcoStruxure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of IT systems supporting trading operations, plus Microsoft Office, Jira, and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain calm under pressure and troubleshoot systems during emergencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to make data-driven recommendations, weighing risks, costs, and impact against high-level intent and long-term implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys working autonomously with little direction, remains solution-oriented, and thrives in fast-paced, ambiguous environments as a naturally curious self-starter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate with all employees for upcoming work and the possible impact on the office environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and predictable availability, with willingness to stagger shifts, work off-hours and some weekends, and be on-call during emergencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification in facilities management (e.g., FMP, CFM, IFMA, OSHA 30, FDNY F-89/T-89/S-95) or equivalent technical training.&lt;br&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a financial, trading, or similarly fast-paced industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Private Medical, Vision and Dental Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Travel Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Group Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Group Life Assurance and Income Protection Schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Parking and Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

b3b5966cbc0c4ec471478b76f5e03a49973b86fb:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the CAO office on business management and change management initiatives both department wide and firm wide.&amp;nbsp; The individual will take responsibility for business deliverables which feed into the firm’s strategic objectives and operational effectiveness. The role provides an opportunity to identify and change processes to enhance efficiencies and promote innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the CAO and CoS for the CAO deliver on their objectives by supporting decisions, communicating messaging, managing internal and external stakeholders and delivering change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business management including commercial contract management, vendor strategy, budgeting and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackling business challenges through data analysis and modelling and business process reengineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Departmental management including townhalls, offsites and other departmental effectiveness focussed initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Producing material where required on behalf of the business unit for committees and other stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change Management - managing cross business unit business and regulatory change along with AI transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting on CAO Office direct responsibilities including Man’s Insurance program and Corporate Sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years’ applicable work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical &amp;nbsp;and technical capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills: able to establish and maintain a close working relationship with a wide range of stakeholders. Must be able to communicate with senior stakeholders effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised self-starter with the ability to effectively manage time across multiple projects and with competing business demands and priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills to ensure clear, concise, and professional communication (both written and verbal) with internal and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
