&lt;p&gt;Our traders work in teams to seek out and profitably trade mispriced securities. The junior traders job responsibilities will include disciplined decision making, risk management, derivative pricing, and researching new opportunities. If you are looking to be a value added member to our team and have an immediate contribution in building out our business, feel free to apply today!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
