&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of production FX spot, forwards, NDFs, swaps, and exotic FX options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of trade lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with OMS platforms and prime broker portals — Bloomberg AIM, Orchestrade, or Geneva experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, high intensity environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

