0bc87a09441a6362d28beb8fcbddd65e46fd93e6:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The global IDI team spans Hong Kong, Sofia, London and now Boston. The team is&amp;nbsp;responsible for implementing&amp;nbsp;all new business and portfolios (funds, Separately Managed Accounts (SMAs), and investment strategies), maintaining the integrity of systematic models, and steering the long-term development of our trading initiatives.&amp;nbsp;Our mission is to ensure every quantitative strategy is implemented with precision and aligned with&amp;nbsp;its&amp;nbsp;investment objectives, from initial research idea through to the last trade.&amp;nbsp;Though London-based and focused&amp;nbsp;primarily on Man AHL’s content, as part of Systematic, you will be part of a connected global network, sharing tooling, codebase, and implementation capabilities across all four locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The problems the team solves are diverse, complex, and high-impact. The team is the primary responder when production issues halt the investment managers, requiring rapid diagnosis and resolution without introducing new risks. The team are the operational architects who translate a researcher’s ideal strategy&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;portfolio into a robust, scalable solution,&amp;nbsp;balancing&amp;nbsp;speed, resilience, and business logic.&amp;nbsp;The team&amp;nbsp;also works closely with other&amp;nbsp;areas&amp;nbsp;such as Portfolio Management and Trading to explain why an algorithm and portfolio optimizer generated&amp;nbsp;specific&amp;nbsp;trades. Finally, we partner with technologists to help design trading architecture that is automated,&amp;nbsp;scalable,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;transparent enough for manual intervention when necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers&amp;nbsp;exceptional&amp;nbsp;exposure. Man Group&#39;s&amp;nbsp;flat structure means&amp;nbsp;your work&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;widely visible across the group, you will be working with portfolio managers, quantitative researchers, product structuring specialists, and traders, with the opportunity and expectation&amp;nbsp;to contribute, propose solutions, and make decisions regardless of seniority. You’ll be supported throughout and as you build confidence, you will represent the global IDI team on cross-departmental working groups and present findings directly to senior management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE PROGRAMME: BUILDING A WELL-ROUNDED ANALYST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a generic graduate scheme where you tour the business and hope to find a home. You are hired explicitly as a future IDI Analyst. However, to be effective in IDI, you must deeply understand the teams you will be interacting with every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this reason, your first 18 months are structured to give you a 360-degree view of how a systematic hedge fund operates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Months 1–6 (IDI Team): &lt;/strong&gt;You begin in IDI, shadowing our core operations. You will learn how we monitor daily portfolio management, implement new research, and drive strategic projects. You will not be making production trading decisions yet; instead, your focus will be on deep-dive data analysis, automating processes, and helping to build out our emerging AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Months 7–18 (Rotations): &lt;/strong&gt;You will complete three tailored 4-month rotations across teams that are key stakeholders of IDI—such as Business Management, Investment Risk, Execution Analytics and Trade Operations &amp;amp; Middle Office Accounting. You are there to understand their pain points, their workflows, how IDI can better support them and build lasting human relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Month 19 onwards: You &lt;/strong&gt;return to IDI permanently, bringing back the cross-functional knowledge necessary to steer complex, cross-departmental implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout this 18-month journey, you will be supported by a dedicated mentor who will guide your technical and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES (FIRST 6 MONTHS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During your initial 6 months within the IDI team, you will not be expected to run the trading system or make production decisions. Instead, you will focus on building your knowledge and delivering value through:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shadowing tasks across the IDI team, including day-to-day portfolio management monitoring, implementation, analytics, and strategic projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automating existing processes and streamlining daily investment management workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting deep-dive data analysis with autonomy, providing meaningful business insights to senior management and improving processes for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building out tooling and the emerging AI capability of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing a thorough understanding of complex systems and interactions, including the ability to sort through dynamic datasets to analyse key indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to AHL&#39;s overall Investment and Data Implementation effort by collaborating with other teams across AHL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY SKILLS &amp;amp; ATTRIBUTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise that technical skills develop over time. We are primarily looking for candidates who demonstrate the right mindset and soft skills to succeed in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic record and higher education degree with high mathematical and computing content (e.g., Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics, Statistics, or other disciplines involving technical and quantitative analysis techniques).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of curiosity and openness to taking on new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable dealing with ambiguity and problem-solving in unstructured environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to interact effectively with peers and senior stakeholders across IDI and other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and the ability to effectively manage time across multiple projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and excellent attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantageous:&lt;/strong&gt;Advantageous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming skills in SQL and an object-oriented language, preferably Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience (such as internships or academic projects) working with technical solutions for operational or data-related tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RECRUITMENT PROCESS &amp;amp; TIMELINES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;The stages are outlined below, along with indicative timelines. Please note that exact dates may shift depending on application volumes and business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-disc pl-[2rem]&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-sm [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:m-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:p-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window:&lt;/strong&gt; 29th July - 20th August 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-sm [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:m-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:p-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aptitude &amp;amp; Coding Tests:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;August – September 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-sm [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:m-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:p-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills and Core Values Assessment Centre:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;September 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-sm [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:m-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:p-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; September/October 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We recruit on a rolling basis and reserve the right to close the application window early if sufficient applications are received. We encourage you to apply as early as possible.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 1000px; height: 565px;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/z3YUoZQVCHQ?si=Mr5TZZZWjNlFwnEb&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; height=&quot;565&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

fb694ec1499cdb7adca56235c64cea7b519eb7ee:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a global alternative investment management firm focused on pursuing outperformance for sophisticated clients via our Systematic, Discretionary and Solutions offerings. Powered by talent and advanced technology, our single and multi-manager investment strategies are underpinned by deep research and span public and private markets, across all major asset classes, with a significant focus on alternatives. Man Group takes a partnership approach to working with clients, establishing deep connections and creating tailored solutions to meet their investment goals and those of the millions of retirees and savers they represent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in London, we manage $253.6 billion* and operate across multiple offices globally. Man Group plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the ticker EMG.LN and is a constituent of the FTSE 250 Index. Further information can be found at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.man.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CSarah.Salta%40man.com%7C50106c0fbadc415bae6b08dd71e5d131%7Cf771e26b93bc4bbe8f6b7cd560ce9350%7C0%7C0%7C638791954087076774%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=5iuJXx8lcIhasW1cs1O9OyY6uKEhZDGiG5RgG9UVIsU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;www.man.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-normal text-sm mb-4 last:mb-0 break-words&quot;&gt;At Man Group, we respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting and safeguarding your Personal Data. We have developed policies and processes which are designed to provide for the security and integrity of your Personal Data. We are committed to Processing your Personal Data fairly and lawfully, and being open and transparent about such Processing. For further information on how we process your data, please see the privacy notice for applicants&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;text-sm font-normal text-light-blue underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.man.com/privacy-notice-job-applicant&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* As at 30 June 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Manager on the Systematic Business Management team, you will partner with colleagues across Boston and London to support the operations, growth, and strategic priorities of the Systematic business unit. No two days look the same. Your work will span product launch support, strategic initiative coordination, meeting and materials preparation, and ensuring the broader needs of the business are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who thrives on variety, takes ownership of problems, and can move fluidly between independent workstreams and close cross-functional collaboration. A background in investment management, product structuring, or experience within an investment management organization will position you to hit the ground running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role and responsibilities will include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Governance&lt;/strong&gt; Support the growth of the Systematic Micro and Macro product ecosystem. While product launches are coordinated by the Product Management team, you will support the governance framework and provide tailored ongoing support for each client: including onboarding coordination, documentation, and lifecycle tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt; Lead projects of varying size, complexity, and subject matter. These will primarily support investment-related initiatives but will regularly span central functions such as Legal, Operations, Technology, and Compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Operational Risk&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify areas where business processes can be streamlined or strengthened. Propose and coordinate improvements while building a working understanding of the unit&#39;s operational risk landscape and supporting related needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Tracking&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and organize key business data including terms and agreement tracking with Legal, operational risk, commercial data, and project dashboards, ensuring information is accurate, accessible, and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meeting Coordination &amp;amp; Follow-Through&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare materials for and coordinate meetings and committees. Drive follow-ups and accountability on action items to keep initiatives moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad-Hoc Strategic Support&lt;/strong&gt; In a fast-moving environment, priorities shift. You&#39;ll be expected to step into emerging challenges with energy and resourcefulness, helping the team respond to evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Communication &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage projects end-to-end: scoping requirements, setting timelines, delegating tasks, and driving deliverables to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying and implementing process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, able to build trust quickly across teams and levels of seniority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify team needs, synthesize information, and present clear recommendations to management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in building relationships with key stakeholders across a global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Working Style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-directed and resourceful&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you prioritize your own workload, operate effectively in ambiguity, and drive work forward without waiting for detailed instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable wearing multiple hats&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you can shift between strategic thinking and hands-on execution in the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in productivity and presentation tools (PowerPoint, Excel, Visio) and comfort leveraging AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity about how the Systematic business unit, and Man Group more broadly operates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical aptitude or familiarity with development lifecycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with investment product structuring or fund operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Business Management, Finance, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;About 5 years of experience in project management, business management, or a comparable operational role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead initiatives and influence stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical thinking, able to synthesize information from multiple sources and deliver actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management skills with the ability to balance multiple concurrent priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Thrive Here If You…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are energized by variety and genuinely enjoy connecting dots across teams and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in driving things to completion even when the path isn&#39;t fully mapped out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to deeply understand how an investment business operates, from portfolio construction to client delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value collaboration but don&#39;t need hand-holding to get things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The anticipated based salary range for this position is listed below. Compensation packages would also include benefits and a discretionary bonus. This is the base salary range that the Company believes it will pay for this position at the time of this posting based on the location and requirements of the position as well as the skills, qualifications, and experience of the applicant.&amp;nbsp; The Firm reserves the right to modify this pay range at any time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Work-Life Balance and Benefits at Man Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll thrive in our working environment that champions equality of opportunity. Your unique perspective will contribute to our success, joining a workplace where inclusion is fundamental and deeply embedded in our culture and values. Through our external and internal initiatives, partnerships and programmes, you&#39;ll find opportunities to grow, develop your talents, and help foster an inclusive environment for all across our firm and industry. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.man.com/diversity&quot;&gt;www.man.com/diversity&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll have opportunities to make a difference through our charitable and global initiatives, while advancing your career through professional development, and with flexible working arrangements available too. Like all our people, you&#39;ll receive two annual &#39;Mankind&#39; days of paid leave for community volunteering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive benefits package includes competitive holiday entitlements, pension/401k, life and long-term disability coverage, group sick pay, enhanced parental leave and long-service leave. Depending on your location, you may also enjoy additional benefits such as private medical coverage, discounted gym membership options and pet insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and all employees without regard to race, color, creed, national origin, ancestry, religion, disability, sex, gender identity and expression, marital status, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, age or any other legally protected category or status in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Man Group is a Disability Confident Committed employer; if you require help or information on reasonable adjustments as you apply for roles with us, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TalentAcquisition@man.com&quot;&gt;TalentAcquisition@man.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 1000px; height: 565px;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/z3YUoZQVCHQ?si=Mr5TZZZWjNlFwnEb&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; height=&quot;565&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

10b77f0b6d81deb3670c5ce9cf99d05cec6627fa:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders are looking for an AI Engineer who wants to work on one of the most exciting engineering challenges at the firm right now. As an AI Engineer on the team, you will design, build, and scale enterprise-grade AI agents and automation workflows across the organization. The focus is on translating real business problems into autonomous agent-driven solutions that integrate reliably with our internal systems, data platforms, and tools.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will work across the full agent lifecycle: from design and development through deployment, evaluation, and production operation, with a strong emphasis on governance, observability, and measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement AI agents capable of planning, reasoning, and executing multi-step workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build single-agent and multi-agent architectures for enterprise use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable agent patterns and templates that other teams can build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy agents on managed platforms (Anthropic, Azure OpenAI, GCP Vertex AI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure secure execution environments, lifecycle management, and session handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Human-in-the-loop escalations and approval gates for high value actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the agent release lifecycle: prompt and config versioning, staged rollouts, and canary releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate agents with our internal data platforms, APIs, and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement RAG pipelines, vector databases, and structured knowledge layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evaluation frameworks measuring accuracy, task completion, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor agent behavior and performance in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement fallback mechanisms, error handling, cost controls, and usage guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure agents operate within our security policies, data access constraints, and regulatory frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain audit trails and explainability of agent actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver solutions covering investigation workflows, reporting, reconciliation, and decision support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement safeguards against hallucinations, unsafe actions, and data leakage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate workflows from Trading, Risk, Compliance, Finance, and Operations into agent-driven automation&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
