&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D Insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Voluntary Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid vacation plus paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Wellness Programs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary Range &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

1578576befca349e56150c515cc85c5434a2007b:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPANY OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition Fund Management LLC (“Verition”) is a multi-strategy, multi-manager hedge fund founded in 2008. Verition focuses on global investment strategies including Credit, Fixed Income &amp;amp; Macro, Convertible &amp;amp; Volatility Arbitrage, Event-Driven, Equity Long/Short &amp;amp; Capital Markets, and Quantitative Strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verition is seeking a motivated Operations Analyst / Associate to join its Post-Trade Support (Futures Operations) team. The Operations Analyst/Associate will support the daily post-trade processing of the firm&#39;s listed futures business, ensuring accurate trade processing, reconciliations, settlements, and margin activities. The role partners with Trading, Portfolio Management, Risk, Finance, and external counterparties to resolve operational issues while maintaining a strong control environment and supporting process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the daily post-trade processing of listed futures and options on futures across global exchanges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely trade allocation, affirmation, and settlement with brokers and clearing firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily reconciliations of trades, positions, cash, and margin balances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve trade breaks, reconciliation exceptions, and settlement discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor contract expirations, rolls, and other futures lifecycle events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Trading, Portfolio Management, Risk, Finance, and external counterparties to resolve operational issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate trade and account data across internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with daily margin processing and collateral movements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute daily operational controls and escalate exceptions when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvements and support automation initiatives to increase operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with system testing, new product launches, and operational projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation of procedures and ensure compliance with internal controls and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of operations experience supporting listed futures, derivatives, or capital markets products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the futures trade lifecycle, including clearing, settlement, reconciliations, and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with trading, clearing, or reconciliation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple priorities in a deadline-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and problem-solving skills with a collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Economics, Business, or a related discipline preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$125,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

eb619fb74a4e5be690161a535181d188b678fc04:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;WorldQuant develops and deploys systematic financial strategies across a broad range of asset classes and global markets. We seek to produce high-quality predictive signals (alphas) through our proprietary research platform to employ financial strategies focused on market inefficiencies. Our teams work collaboratively to drive the production of alphas and financial strategies – the foundation of a balanced, global investment platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WorldQuant is built on a culture that pairs academic sensibility with accountability for results. Employees are encouraged to think openly about problems, balancing intellectualism and practicality. Excellent ideas come from anyone, anywhere. Employees are encouraged to challenge conventional thinking and possess an attitude of continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire the best and the brightest. We value intellectual horsepower first and foremost, and people who demonstrate an outstanding talent. There is no roadmap to future success, so we need people who can help us build it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Our distributed platform combines high-performance storage, compute, and service layers for processing and serving massive, structured, time-series datasets - built in C++ with a distributed system architecture, real-time streaming, RPC-based data transfer, and columnar on-disk storage that powers data processing and analytics workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain core components across our distributed storage, compute, and service platforms - including storage engines, query and compute execution, RPC/networking layers, and distributed coordination (routing, partitioning, replication).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders across research and engineering teams to translate data-access, compute, and performance requirements into concrete design and implementation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve production issues - from correctness bugs to performance regressions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code review, system design, feature development, and productionization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals in data structures, algorithms, and systems-level thinking (memory management, concurrency, I/O).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in modern C++ (C++11 or higher); comfort with STL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of UNIX/Linux development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted coding tools (e.g., Claude Code, OpenCode) to accelerate development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, proactive communicator who works well with a globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to distributed systems concepts (replication, sharding, consensus), query/compute engines, or columnar/analytical storage formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RPC frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you acknowledge and consent to terms of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.worldquant.com/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WorldQuant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; The privacy policy offers an explanation of how and why your data will be collected, how it will be used and disclosed, how it will be retained and secured, and what legal rights are associated with that data (including the rights of access, correction, and deletion). The policy also describes legal and contractual limitations on these rights. The specific rights and obligations of individuals living and working in different areas may vary by jurisdiction.&lt;/p&gt;
